Project Identification
Project Name: E-commerce Product Review & Rating System

Target Domain: Online Retail & E-commerce Operations

Primary Stakeholders: Store Managers, Verified Buyers, E-commerce Operations Team

Executive Summary & System Context
Current State of the System
The current system suffers from significant operational limitations:

Lack of Customer Confidence: Buyers hesitate to finalize purchases due to sparse and unverified customer feedback.

High Returns & Cancellations: Lack of real customer photos leads to misaligned expectations regarding product quality and dimensions.

Manual Moderation Overhead: Store administrators spend excessive hours checking for spam, inappropriate language, and promotional links.

Lack of Analytics: Store managers have no centralized dashboard to quickly spot low-rated or defective products across categories.

System Goals
Boost Sales Conversion: Increase buyer trust by displaying verified buyer badges, detailed star breakdowns, and customer media uploads.

Automate Content Moderation: Implement automated filters to detect spam, abusive content, and fake duplicate reviews.

Minimize Return Rates: Ensure prospective buyers receive realistic product impressions prior to checkout.

Deliver Managerial Insights: Build an analytics dashboard displaying key metrics (top-rated items, low-performing SKUs, sentiment trends).

Interview Analysis Report
1. Interview Opinion
Stakeholder Perspective: Interviewees overwhelmingly agree that the existing review mechanism is inadequate and negatively impacts store revenue.

Key Observations:

Managers feel that current reviews do not accurately reflect true product quality.

Customers view unverified reviews with skepticism, suspecting seller manipulation.

System administrators find manual moderation inefficient and unsustainable as product inventory scales.

2. Interview Feelings
Frustration & Concern: High levels of anxiety regarding fake reviews damaging store credibility and brand reputation.

Eagerness for Automation: Stakeholders expressed strong excitement for modern features such as AI moderation, automated verification tags, and instant photo/video rendering.

Optimism for Transformation: Confidence that transitioning to a modernized review module will significantly increase sales conversion and customer satisfaction.

